{"sha": "fe95098e2f90e0ddbb157fa66b195668723d1fad937441360f0c45a89ae22c8e", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:g9:sqrt} 章 --- 平方根}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g9:sqrt:1}", "$\\sqrt{64} = 8$; \\quad $\\sqrt{100} = 10$; \\quad", "$\\sqrt{0.09} = 0.3$（因为 $0.3^2 = 0.09$）； \\quad", "$\\sqrt{\\frac{1}{25}} = \\frac15$; \\quad", "$\\left(\\sqrt{13}\\right)^2 = 13$; \\quad", "$\\sqrt{(-4)^2} = \\sqrt{16} = 4 = \\abs{-4}$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g9:sqrt:2}", "$\\sqrt{50} = \\sqrt{25 \\times 2} = 5\\sqrt2$; \\quad", "$\\sqrt{45} = \\sqrt{9 \\times 5} = 3\\sqrt5$; \\quad", "$\\sqrt{98} = \\sqrt{49 \\times 2} = 7\\sqrt2$; \\quad", "$\\sqrt{300} = \\sqrt{100 \\times 3} = 10\\sqrt3$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g9:sqrt:3}", "$\\sqrt2 \\times \\sqrt{18} = \\sqrt{36} = 6$.", "", "$\\dfrac{\\sqrt{75}}{\\sqrt3} = \\sqrt{\\dfrac{75}{3}} = \\sqrt{25} = 5$.", "", "$\\sqrt5 \\times \\sqrt{20} = \\sqrt{100} = 10$.", "", "$\\dfrac{\\sqrt8}{\\sqrt{50}} = \\sqrt{\\dfrac{8}{50}} = \\sqrt{\\dfrac{4}{25}}", "= \\dfrac25$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g9:sqrt:4}", "$x^2 = 36$：$x = 6$ 或 $x = -6$。", "", "$x^2 = 11$：$x = \\sqrt{11}$ 或 $x = -\\sqrt{11}$。", "", "$x^2 + 4 = 0$ 即 $x^2 = -4 < 0$：无解。", "", "$2x^2 = 50$：$x^2 = 25$，于是 $x = 5$ 或 $x = -5$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g9:sqrt:5}", "$\\sqrt{20} + \\sqrt{45} = 2\\sqrt5 + 3\\sqrt5 = 5\\sqrt5$.", "", "$3\\sqrt8 - \\sqrt{18} + \\sqrt2 = 3 \\times 2\\sqrt2 - 3\\sqrt2 + \\sqrt2", "= (6 - 3 + 1)\\sqrt2 = 4\\sqrt2$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g9:sqrt:6}", "$\\left(\\sqrt3 + 1\\right)^2 = 3 + 2\\sqrt3 + 1 = 4 + 2\\sqrt3$.", "", "$\\left(2\\sqrt5 - 3\\right)^2 = 4 \\times 5 - 2 \\times 3 \\times 2\\sqrt5 + 9", "= 29 - 12\\sqrt5$.", "", "$\\left(\\sqrt6 + \\sqrt2\\right)\\left(\\sqrt6 - \\sqrt2\\right) = 6 - 2 = 4$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g9:sqrt:7}", "边长：$\\sqrt{6400} = 80$ 米。对角线（毕达哥拉斯定理）：", "$\\sqrt{80^2 + 80^2} = 80\\sqrt2 \\approx 113$ 米。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g9:sqrt:8}", "$\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt2} = \\dfrac{1 \\times \\sqrt2}{\\sqrt2 \\times \\sqrt2}", "= \\dfrac{\\sqrt2}{2}$.", "", "$\\dfrac{6}{\\sqrt3} = \\dfrac{6\\sqrt3}{3} = 2\\sqrt3$.", "\\quad", "$\\dfrac{10}{\\sqrt5} = \\dfrac{10\\sqrt5}{5} = 2\\sqrt5$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g9:sqrt:9}", "\\emph{1. 对}：这是乘积法则（见\\cref{thm:g9:sqrt:rules}）。", "", "\\emph{2. 错}：$\\sqrt{9 + 16} = 5$，但 $\\sqrt9 + \\sqrt{16} = 7$。", "", "\\emph{3. 错}：当 $x$ 为负数时，$\\sqrt{(-4)^2} = 4 \\neq -4$。正确的", "结论是 $\\sqrt{x^2} = \\abs{x}$。", "", "\\emph{4. 对}：$\\left(3\\sqrt2\\right)^2 = 9 \\times 2 = 18$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g9:sqrt:10}", "$\\left(2 + \\sqrt3\\right)^2 = 4 + 4\\sqrt3 + 3 = 7 + 4\\sqrt3$。因此", "$x = \\sqrt{7 + 4\\sqrt3} = \\sqrt{\\left(2+\\sqrt3\\right)^2} = 2 + \\sqrt3$", "（这是一个非负数，因此开方只是去掉平方）。", "", "类似地，$\\left(\\sqrt5 - 2\\right)^2 = 5 - 4\\sqrt5 + 4 = 9 - 4\\sqrt5$，", "且 $\\sqrt5 - 2 > 0$，故", "$\\sqrt{9 - 4\\sqrt5} = \\sqrt5 - 2$（不是 $2 - \\sqrt5$，后者", "为负数！）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:g9:sqrt:1}", "\\textbf{1.} $1.4^2 = 1.96 < 2 < 2.25 = 1.5^2$；", "$1.41^2 = 1.9881 < 2 < 2.0164 = 1.42^2$。取三位小数：", "$1.414^2 = 1.999396 < 2 < 2.002225 = 1.415^2$，于是", "$1.414 < \\sqrt2 < 1.415$.", "", "\\textbf{2.} 将 $\\sqrt2 = \\frac ab$ 两边平方，得", "$2 = \\frac{a^2}{b^2}$，从而 $a^2 = 2b^2$，即数 $a^2$ 是", "某个整数的两倍 --- \\emph{偶数}。", "", "\\textbf{3.} 若 $a$ 为奇数，则 $a^2$ 为奇数", "（见\\cref{pb:g8:pythagoras:1}）；由于 $a^2$ 为偶数，故 $a$ 为偶数：", "$a = 2k$。代入得 $4k^2 = 2b^2$，于是 $b^2 = 2k^2$ 为偶数，", "由同样的奇偶性可知 $b$ 为偶数。", "", "\\textbf{4.} $a$ 与 $b$ 均为偶数，即二者都能被 $2$ 整除", "--- 但 $\\frac ab$ 是既约分数，二者没有公", "因数。矛盾：假设的分数不可能存在。", "\\emph{定理：$\\sqrt2$ 是无理数。}", ""]}